desc:JigDAW Gain Trim

// A worked example for bin/jsfx-import.js: as small as a JSFX effect gets,
// one slider and one multiply, proving the pipeline end to end before the
// other two fixtures exercise persistent state and control flow.

slider1:gain=0<-24,24,0.1>Gain (dB)

@slider
g = pow(10, gain / 20);

@sample
spl0 *= g;
spl1 *= g;
